            "detailed_description": "8i brings virtual experiences to life with the highest fidelity, most realistic volumetric video of humans. A truly immersive experience, volumetric VR gives you a sense of presence and freedom to move through space and time, opening up worlds of possibilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8i volumetric VR experience features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrue presence: Step into the story and feel like you’re not just watching someone, you’re with them.<br />\r\nFreedom of movement: Walk completely around the person you’re watching as if you’re in the same room, and choose your own perspective.<br />\r\nExperience it anywhere: View on virtual reality headset, mobile and on the web",
