                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very interested in the tech here, but the performance on my GTX 970 is just abysmal.  Anytime I look at a character (especially in boxing), my PC goes into constant reprojection (45 fps).  It even sometimes can't keep up with reprojection and drops frames even then.\n\nAnything you can do to lower the poly count of the captures models?  I understand you're using ray-traced data, but my card simply can't keep up.\n\nFix the performance issues, add some additional characters and content, and I'll definitely reconsider!",
